### Translate Documents

{{partyLabel}} has uploaded documents that require translation.

Review the defendant submitted document in
<a href="/cases/case-details/PCS/PCS/{{caseReference}}#Case%20File%20View">Case File View</a> and arrange
translation where required. Upload or record the translated document on the case file and take any further action needed.
Only mark the task as complete once the translation has been completed and any required action has been taken.

Documents:
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  {% for filename in filenames %}
  <li class="govuk-!-font-size-19">{{filename}}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
